DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
42247::$$$message_0332_0000_0000$$$::"..."::
42248::$$$message_0332_0000_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
42249::$$$message_0332_0000_0002$$$::(*reading)::
42250::$$$message_0332_0000_0003$$$::"...............................................................................................................................................................[wvl][hffacechg chara=蒔寺 face=哀 layer=0 time=300]Haaah."::
42251::$$$message_0332_0000_0004$$$::"Hey, Kane. I've been keeping this a secret, but I'm actually a woman from the stars who'll die if I ever get bored. Did you know?"::
42252::$$$message_0332_0000_0005$$$::"Yeah. You were born in a commonwealth and you would be beautiful if you just kept your mouth shut. Such a dilemma."::
42253::$$$message_0332_0000_0006$$$::"Hey, you.[lr]::
42254::$$$message_0332_0000_0007$$$::Sorry to ask, [se storage=se269.wav]but get me another coffee."::
42255::$$$message_0332_0000_0008$$$::"Don't just ignore me!"::
42256::$$$message_0332_0000_0009$$$::"Listen, Kane. What you lack is self-awareness! A sense of danger![wvl canskip=0 time=300][hffacechg chara=蒔寺 face=喜 layer=0 time=300][hfsigh layer=0] Also, the pluck to treat your friends when they're broke!"::
42257::$$$message_0332_0000_0010$$$::"You're being noisier than usual. Something on your mind?[lr]::
42258::$$$message_0332_0000_0011$$$::It's usually some ridiculous mess you need me to clean up for you."::
42259::$$$message_0332_0000_0012$$$::"N-nuh uh! I'm not hiding anything![lr]::
42260::$$$message_0332_0000_0013$$$::I just wasn't talking about it! Really!"::
42261::$$$message_0332_0000_0014$$$::"Never mind that. I just, y'know, think this is a pretty crazy situation. Somehow."::
42262::$$$message_0332_0000_0015$$$::"...Hm. Well, we're girls sitting alone in a cafe during the day on a weekend. Is there an issue with that?"::
42263::$$$message_0332_0000_0016$$$::"Huh? Nothing wrong with that.[lr]::
42264::$$$message_0332_0000_0017$$$::We're always fine when there's just three of us."::
42265::$$$message_0332_0000_0018$$$::"I'm talking about the deathly boredom, and how I don't want to stay in Miyama until it gets dark."::
42266::$$$message_0332_0000_0019$$$::"...(I see. I thought it was my fault there isn't any lively conversation, but it was because of this...)"::
42267::$$$message_0332_0000_0020$$$::"...Very well.[lr]::
42268::$$$message_0332_0000_0021$$$::Then why don't we go walk around until Yukika arrives?"::
42269::$$$message_0332_0000_0022$$$::"Fortunately, I've some funds in hand. Our war chest won't run dry."::
42270::$$$message_0332_0000_0023$$$::"Woo-hoo! I knew I could count on the bourgeoisie![lr]::
42271::$$$message_0332_0000_0024$$$::Yukika sure is taking a while, though."::
42272::$$$message_0332_0000_0025$$$::"It's unusual for her to be late. I wonder if she ran into trouble...[wvs][se storage=se548.wav]"::
42273::$$$message_0332_0000_0026$$$::"Oh, there she is.[lr]::
42274::$$$message_0332_0000_0027$$$::Hey, Yukika! Over here! [wvl][hffacechg chara=蒔寺 face=驚 layer=0 time=200]...Wait."::
42275::$$$message_0332_0000_0028$$$::"B-big news, Maki, Kane! I heard something incredible...![wvl canskip=0 time=400][hffacechg chara=由紀香 face=哀 layer=1 time=200][hfsweat layer=1][hfsigh layer=1] And sorry I'm late!"::
42276::$$$message_0332_0000_0029$$$::"H-hey. It's fine, we didn't wait long.[lr]::
42277::$$$message_0332_0000_0030$$$::Anyway, try to calm down. Want some water?"::
42278::$$$message_0332_0000_0031$$$::"Yeah. Thanks."[wvs canskip=0 time=400][nolr][se storage=se410.wav volume=70][wait canskip=0 time=600][se storage=se410.wav volume=70][wait canskip=0 time=600][se storage=se410.wav volume=70][wait canskip=0 time=600]::
42279::$$$message_0332_0000_0032$$$::"Looks like you've calmed down.[lr]::
42280::$$$message_0332_0000_0033$$$::So what's this incredible news, Yukika?"::
42281::$$$message_0332_0000_0034$$$::"Did you know there's an onsen behind Ryudou Temple?"::
42282::$$$message_0332_0000_0035$$$::"..."::
42283::$$$message_0332_0000_0036$$$::"...No, I didn't.[lr]::
42284::$$$message_0332_0000_0037$$$::And Maki's face says it all. I didn't think there was anything like that back there."::
42285::$$$message_0332_0000_0038$$$::"Me neither, but apparently it's a secret hot spring that only bubbles up once a year."::
42286::$$$message_0332_0000_0039$$$::"Only a few people in Fuyuki know about it, and it's said to grant the wish of the first person to enter each year."::
42287::$$$message_0332_0000_0040$$$::"N-[wvl canskip=0 time=300]no way. [wvl canskip=0 time=400]You're so silly, Yukicchi. The only people who would believe that are pure, innocent girls, [wvl][hfpop layer=0]or greedy goblins like me!"::
42288::$$$message_0332_0000_0041$$$::"Also there's already a story about a secret phantom hot spring."::
42289::$$$message_0332_0000_0042$$$::"Oh... Really?[lr]::
42290::$$$message_0332_0000_0043$$$::But I heard it from little Gil... He even gave me tickets."::
42291::$$$message_0332_0000_0044$$$::"I'm not blaming you for anything, Yukicchi!"::
42292::$$$message_0332_0000_0045$$$::"Just saying that we should leave the spooky stuff to people like Tohsaka, and that it's definitely a waste of our[line len=2]"::
42293::$$$message_0332_0000_0046$$$::"...Hm. Wait, Maki.[lr]::
42294::$$$message_0332_0000_0047$$$::Yukika's story isn't that far-fetched."::
42295::$$$message_0332_0000_0048$$$::"There certainly are such stories about the mountain.[lr]::
42296::$$$message_0332_0000_0049$$$::Ryudou Temple is named after the dragon's cave in the mountain, and the underground spring is supposedly a source of magical power."::
42297::$$$message_0332_0000_0050$$$::"There are tales of people who were miraculously cured of illness or obtained great riches once a year. That's consistent with what she just said."::
42298::$$$message_0332_0000_0051$$$::"Huh... [wvl canskip=0 time=300]That does sound pretty dreamy. But I'm too pure to wish for anything like that."::
42299::$$$message_0332_0000_0052$$$::"Don't you think it's a good opportunity?[lr]::
42300::$$$message_0332_0000_0053$$$::I thought you were dying of boredom.[lr]::
42301::$$$message_0332_0000_0054$$$::Why don't we go check it out together?"::
42302::$$$message_0332_0000_0055$$$::"Well, um..."::
42303::$$$message_0332_0000_0056$$$::"Yeah!"::
42304::$$$message_0332_0000_0057$$$::"Maki, you were saying you were so bored you wished something as exciting as being reborn would happen!"::
42305::$$$message_0332_0000_0058$$$::"Hey![lr]::
42306::$$$message_0332_0000_0059$$$::[small]I...don't have a crazy wish like that, nah..."[nolr]::
42307::$$$message_0332_0000_0060$$$::"That's right, Kane. Gil said that other people are trying to reach the onsen, and that we can play hanafuda against them if we run into them."::
42308::$$$message_0332_0000_0061$$$::"Hanafuda?[lr]::
42309::$$$message_0332_0000_0062$$$::Now this sounds promising. Hanafuda is Maki's specialty. It's your time to shine, Kaede."::
42310::$$$message_0332_0000_0063$$$::"Really!?[lr]::
42311::$$$message_0332_0000_0064$$$::Yay! We're counting on you, Maki![lr]::
42312::$$$message_0332_0000_0065$$$::Show them why you're called the [hfwww layer=1]Black Panther of Homurahara!"::
42313::$$$message_0332_0000_0066$$$::"Oof... You're so aggressive all of a sudden, Yukicchi."::
42314::$$$message_0332_0000_0067$$$::"...As a fellow innocent maiden, I won't let you down."::
42315::$$$message_0332_0000_0068$$$::"Yeah, I'm a girl, too![lr]::
42316::$$$message_0332_0000_0069$$$::I can tell how this is going to end, but no pain, no gain!"::
42317::$$$message_0332_0000_0070$$$::"Follow me, girls![lr]::
42318::$$$message_0332_0000_0071$$$::I'll show you the shortest path [hfpop layer=0]to the tea leaf onsen of your dreams!"::

